.E. Schmidt, Retriever, Country Lane, Ridgecut, Countyline, Royal Wing, Country Tuff, Strive, Dumor, Traveller, Farm Table, Treeline, Groundwork, TSC Tractor Supply Co, Huskee, Untamed, JobSmart, and Impeckable brand names. The company operates its retail stores under the Tractor Supply Company, Petsense by Tractor Supply, and Orscheln Farm and Home names; and operates websites under the TractorSupply.com and Petsense.com names. It sells its products to recreational farmers, ranchers, and others. Tractor Supply Company was founded in 1938 and is based in Brentwood, Tennessee.","employees":54000,"website":"https://www.tractorsupply.com","country":"United States","city":"Brentwood","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Harry A. Lawton III","title":"President, CEO & Director"},{"name":"Mr. Kurt D. Barton CPA","title":"Executive VP, CFO & Treasurer"},{"name":"Mr. John P. Ordus","title":"Executive VP & Chief Stores Officer"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":14.23,"tpe":18.92,"ps":1.213,"pfcf":19.95,"peg":1.125,"pb":2.874,"ev_ebitda":11.6,"rev_growth":0.058,"eps_growth":0.167,"eps_growth_fwd":0.1068,"eps_growth_next":0.1284,"div_yield":0.0077,"roe":0.1518,"roa":0.06079,"de":109.9,"gross_margin":0.3789,"op_margin":0.09691,"profit_margin":0.05663,"current_ratio":1.447},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":15.51,"sector":14.23,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":17.23,"sector":18.92,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":1.047,"sector":1.213,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":144.8,"sector":19.95,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":2.06,"sector":1.125,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"pb","label":"Price / Book","v":6.271,"sector":2.874,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"de","label":"Debt / Equity (%)","v":252.6,"sector":109.9,"verdict":"High debt"},{"k":"rev_growth","label":"Revenue growth","v":0.051,"sector":0.058,"verdict":"In line"},{"k":"eps_growth","label":"EPS growth (last qtr, y/y)","v":-